# Tell Linguist to count the notebook's code as Python.
# A .ipynb is Python plus markdown plus saved output; GitHub labels the whole file
# "Jupyter Notebook" and gives it its own slice of the language bar. Since every line of
# code in this repository lives in that notebook, the bar reads "Jupyter Notebook 100%"
# and hides the fact that the work is Python.
*.ipynb linguist-language=Python
